IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAYROLL.
*> Weekly payroll: overtime at 1.5x past 40 hours, three tax brackets,
*> flat benefits fee. Each money step is rounded when stored.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT IN-FILE  ASSIGN TO "INPUT.DAT"  ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
    SELECT OUT-FILE ASSIGN TO "OUTPUT.DAT" ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD IN-FILE.
    COPY INREC.
FD OUT-FILE.
    COPY OUTREC.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-EOF    PIC X VALUE "N".
01 WS-REG    PIC 9(6)V99.
01 WS-OT     PIC 9(6)V99.
01 WS-GROSS  PIC 9(6)V99.
01 WS-TAX    PIC 9(6)V99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    OPEN INPUT IN-FILE OUTPUT OUT-FILE
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = "Y"
        READ IN-FILE
            AT END MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF
            NOT AT END PERFORM PROCESS-PARA
        END-READ
    END-PERFORM
    CLOSE IN-FILE OUT-FILE
    STOP RUN.
PROCESS-PARA.
    MOVE IN-EMP-ID TO OUT-EMP-ID
    IF IN-HOURS > 40
        COMPUTE WS-REG ROUNDED = 40 * IN-RATE
        COMPUTE WS-OT ROUNDED = (IN-HOURS - 40) * IN-RATE * 1.5
    ELSE
        COMPUTE WS-REG ROUNDED = IN-HOURS * IN-RATE
        MOVE 0 TO WS-OT
    END-IF
    COMPUTE WS-GROSS = WS-REG + WS-OT
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN WS-GROSS <= 500
            COMPUTE WS-TAX ROUNDED = WS-GROSS * 0.10
        WHEN WS-GROSS <= 1500
            COMPUTE WS-TAX ROUNDED = 50 + (WS-GROSS - 500) * 0.20
        WHEN OTHER
            COMPUTE WS-TAX ROUNDED = 250 + (WS-GROSS - 1500) * 0.30
    END-EVALUATE
    MOVE WS-GROSS TO OUT-GROSS
    MOVE WS-TAX TO OUT-TAX
    IF IN-HOURS > 0
        COMPUTE OUT-NET = WS-GROSS - WS-TAX - 12.50
    ELSE
        MOVE 0 TO OUT-NET
    END-IF
    WRITE OUT-REC.
